                ```sql
                select nvl(count(1),0) display_value
                 , nvl(count(1),0) return_value
                from pedidosremessasct p 
                where p.idcompratransferencia = :P331_IDCOMPRATRANSFERENCIA
                  and :P331_IDCOMPRATRANSFERENCIA is not null
                group by p.idcompratransferencia
                ```
